   "lmg": "x 0.95 = 5.75 (measured 5.75)"
  }
 },
 "inference": [
  "FastSprintRequired has two effects. It makes FastSprintActive true (outside single player and when the per-team mutator allows it), which selects the top-speed multiplier 2.05 instead of 1.857; and while sprinting it caps the weapon speed modifier at 1.0 instead of 1.1818. The cap is why the adrenaline boost does not stack on a knife.",
  "1.1 is one shared sprint boost for four affectors (Medical Triage sprint, Adrenaline Shot, Enhanced Filtering, Swift Triage sprint); it multiplies with the traitsprintspeed input. 0.95 is the LMG penalty, applied on the LMG or MachineGun tag unless a flag that is probably the Support proficiency is set, and only in one stance.",
  "1.1818 is the ceiling on the combined weapon speed modifier for items without fast sprint, not the knife bonus itself. This corrects L4015, which matched it to the knife by value.",
  "Fast sprint also multiplies sprint recovery time by 1.75.",
  "Knife 7.175 and Sledgehammer 6.4995 follow from walk speed 3.5 times the selected multiplier, matching the measurements within their precision."
 ],
